        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF147 supports WebGPU on on all macOS versions on apple silicon in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993341\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993341</a>.<br>\nPreviously it was only supported on Tahoe - I can't find a bug for that, but this issue stated that it was added for Tahoe in 145. It isn't supported on Linux. It isn't supported on macOS on Intel.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have updated the (partial) subfeatures in the 250+ places that support is recorded.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3699234339\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42247\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42247/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42247\">mdn/content#42247</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28604",
            "title": "FF147 WebGPU supported on all apple silicon",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-15T01:10:27.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-08T03:40:35.000Z",
